{"seq":2,"slug":"foreign-literature","title":"外国语言文学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature","introMarkdown":"# 外国语言文学 简介\n\n外国语言文学是一个以世界各民族文学传统和语言实践为研究对象的广阔学科，它打开了一扇通往不同文化想象和思维方式的窗户。从荷马史诗到拉美魔幻现实主义，从莎士比亚到村上春树，每一种文学传统都蕴含着独特的审美逻辑和对人类处境的深层思考。\n\n对于自学者而言，外国文学的入口往往是翻译作品，但真正深入这一领域需要逐步建立原语阅读能力，或者至少培养对翻译过程中语言转换问题的敏感意识。一部优秀的外国文学作品，在不同译者笔下可能呈现截然不同的面貌，这本身就是翻译学的迷人之处。语言能力与文学鉴赏力的相互促进，构成了这门学科的内在动力。\n\n第一章**西方文学**从古希腊悲剧和中世纪骑士传奇出发，经由文艺复兴、启蒙运动和浪漫主义，追踪至现代主义和后现代文学，勾勒欧美文学传统的主要脉络。第二章**亚洲文学**关注日本、韩国和南亚等地区的文学创作，打破以西方为中心的文学视野，发现东方叙事传统的丰富性。第三章**翻译学**从翻译理论的基本命题出发，探讨文学翻译的特殊性和口译的实践方法，是连接语言学习与文学研究的桥梁。第四章**比较文学**提供跨文化、跨语言的文学研究方法，帮助在不同文学传统之间建立对话、发现共性与差异。\n\n建议以某一语种或地区的文学为主线深入学习，而非试图同时覆盖所有传统。在精读代表作品的同时，关注文学思潮的跨国传播——比如自然主义如何从法国影响到日本，魔幻现实主义如何从拉美辐射到亚非文学——这种比较视角能极大地深化对单一文学传统的理解。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"western-literature","title":"西方文学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/western-literature","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"european-literary-traditions","title":"欧洲文学传统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/western-literature/european-literary-traditions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"american-literature","title":"美国文学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/western-literature/american-literature"},{"seq":3,"slug":"postcolonial-literature","title":"后殖民文学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/western-literature/postcolonial-literature"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"asian-literature","title":"亚洲文学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/asian-literature","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"japanese-literature","title":"日本文学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/asian-literature/japanese-literature"},{"seq":2,"slug":"korean-literature","title":"韩国文学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/asian-literature/korean-literature"},{"seq":3,"slug":"south-asian-literature","title":"南亚文学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/asian-literature/south-asian-literature"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"translation-studies","title":"翻译学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/translation-studies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"translation-theory","title":"翻译理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/translation-studies/translation-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"literary-translation","title":"文学翻译","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/translation-studies/literary-translation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"interpreting-studies","title":"口译研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/translation-studies/interpreting-studies"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"comparative-literature","title":"比较文学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/comparative-literature","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"comparative-methods","title":"比较方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/comparative-literature/comparative-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-cultural-literary-studies","title":"跨文化文学研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/comparative-literature/cross-cultural-literary-studies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"world-literature-concept","title":"世界文学概念","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/literature/foreign-literature/comparative-literature/world-literature-concept"}]}]}